{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8c78100d-3fa9-410e-b0bf-8cadc1824628",
    "name": "Food Delivery API",
    "description": "# 🍔 Food Delivery Microservices API\n\nOfficial API Collection for the **Food Delivery Platform**.\n\n---\n\n## 💡 Collection Features:\n- **Manual Development Mode**: Clean real-world requests and body payloads (no hardcoded `TEST` strings in request views).\n- **Automated Collection Runner Ready**: Test scripts dynamically adapt whether you click **Send** manually or execute via **Run Collection**.\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Dynamic Environment Variables:\n- `baseUrl`: `http://localhost:3000`\n- `token`: Bearer access token (automatically saved)\n- `refreshToken`: Refresh token (automatically saved)\n- `userId`: Current user ID\n- `restaurantId`: Created or selected restaurant ID\n- `menuItemId`: Created or selected menu item ID\n- `orderId`: Created order ID",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "57587615"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth Service",
      "description": "User lifecycle, JWT authentication, tokens, profiles, and delivery addresses.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// If userEmail is not manually set, generate a dynamic email for Collection Runner",
                  "var currentEmail = pm.collectionVariables.get('userEmail');",
                  "if (!currentEmail || currentEmail.indexOf('@') === -1) {",
                  "    var uniqueEmail = 'user_' + Date.now() + '@delivery.com';",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userEmail', uniqueEmail);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201 Created or 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (res.result && res.result.data) {",
                  "        if (res.result.data.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.result.data.accessToken);",
                  "        if (res.result.data.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.result.data.refreshToken);",
                  "        if (res.result.data.user && res.result.data.user.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', res.result.data.user.id);",
                  "        console.log('✅ Registered User ID:', res.result.data.user.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\",\n    \"firstName\": \"Ozan\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Demircan\",\n    \"phone\": \"+12125550199\",\n    \"role\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 👤 Register User\nRegisters a new user. If `userEmail` variable is empty, it automatically assigns a unique timestamped email."
          },
          "response": []
        },
